WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 7.1 · Brand, Identity & Image
Brand, marketing and communications

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Brand is what people expect from you; identity, communications and marketing express it.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Write what each audience says about you now.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Name the evidence behind each view.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Describe what you want people to expect.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Imara: safe, hands-on science led by local women scientists. Today: three logo versions and some parents confusing us with tutoring.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your current image and the brand you want.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
